      "title": "Dividend of ₹2.00 announced",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹2.00 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 5th August 2026 Payment date: 11th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.7%, which is about the same as the industry average. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (20% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (35% cash payout ratio). The company is yet to establish a track record of dividend growth or stability as it hasn't paid a regular dividend for at least 2 years. The company's earnings per share (EPS) would need to decline by 78% to shift the payout ratio to a potentially unsustainable range, which is more than the 7.1% EPS decline seen over the last 5 years.",
